{"id":"54b191461f9c19db","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-size.md","title":"df-size","display":"df-size","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","depends_on":["[[56-df-terms]]"],"label":"56-df-size","aliases":["56-df-size"],"display":"df-size","type":"definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e02461ce48023cc\" href=\"?note=5e02461ce48023cc\" title=\"56-df-terms\">56-df-terms</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-size"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-size</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-size"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-size\"><code>df-size</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e02461ce48023cc\" href=\"?note=5e02461ce48023cc\" title=\"56-df-terms\">56-df-terms</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(x\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathcal F\">\\(f\\in\\mathcal F\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=\\operatorname{ar}(f)\">\\(k=\\operatorname{ar}(f)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)\\in T^k\">\\((t_1,\\ldots,t_k)\\in T^k\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{size}:T\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0},\\qquad\\operatorname{size}(x)\\coloneqq1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{size}:T\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0},\\qquad\\operatorname{size}(x)\\coloneqq1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{size}(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_k))\\coloneqq1+\\sum_{i=1}^{k}\\operatorname{size}(t_i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{size}(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_k))\\coloneqq1+\\sum_{i=1}^{k}\\operatorname{size}(t_i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|t|\\coloneqq\\operatorname{size}(t)\\qquad(t\\in T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|t|\\coloneqq\\operatorname{size}(t)\\qquad(t\\in T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>计数变量与函数符号的出现次数，包含常元；零元情形由空和为0得到大小1。递归针对真子项，因而良定义。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>，§2.1，印刷第26页，OCR页块47。本次据用户提供的本地 DjVu 文字层核对陈述；OCR页块序号不等同于物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-size","text":"`df-size`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-terms","status":"resolved","id":"5e02461ce48023cc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-terms","status":"resolved","id":"5e02461ce48023cc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$ 如 [[56-df-terms]]，$\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"k=\\operatorname{ar}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"(t_1,\\ldots,t_k)\\in T^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{size}:T\\to\\mathbb N_{>0},\\qquad\\operatorname{size}(x)\\coloneqq1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{size}(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_k))\\coloneqq1+\\sum_{i=1}^{k}\\operatorname{size}(t_i).","display":true},{"tex":"|t|\\coloneqq\\operatorname{size}(t)\\qquad(t\\in T).","display":true}],"bytes":1012,"backlinks":[{"id":"eafb5a2123c30027","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$；$\\succ\\subseteq F^2$ 满足 $\\mathrm{StrictOrder}(F,\\succ)$。取 $\\tau\\in\\prod_{f\\in F}\\mathrm{Stat}_{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}$、$Q\\subseteq T^2$、$s,t\\in T$。$|t|$ 为 [[56-df-size]] 的有限项大小；$s=f(\\vec s)$ 表示 $f\\in F$、$\\vec s\\in T^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}$，同样使用 $t=g(\\vec t)$。$\\mathrm{Lift}$ 见 [[56-df-lexicographic-extension]]。以下 $\\Phi(Q)$ 的内部递归按 $|s|+|t|$ 作良基递归，$Q$ 只作为 status 提升的已给定关系；$>_{\\mathrm{rpo}}$ 的所有参数为 $(\\Sigma,V,\\succ,\\tau)$。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-371","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-size]]"},{"id":"3c6237425d7c09fc","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$E,F\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot$、$\\delta\\in S$，且 $E\\xrightarrow{\\delta}_{\\mathrm{MM}}F$，见 [[56-df-mm-unification-step]]。后缀组合见 [[56-df-substitution-composition]]；有限项大小见 [[56-df-size]]。"}],"outgoing":["5e02461ce48023cc"]}